      "title": "[HCM] Cloud Project Manager (upto 120M) - Fluent in English",
      "description": "## Job Overview & Responsibilities\n\n* Design and implement secure, scalable AWS and Azure cloud architectures aligned with enterprise security and compliance standards.\n* Deploy, migrate, integrate, and operate cloud solutions across Day 1 and Day 2 activities.\n* Evaluate cloud-native services and recommend solutions to improve scalability, resilience, security, and cost efficiency.\n* Automate infrastructure and operations using **Terraform, CloudFormation, ARM templates, CI/CD, and monitoring tools**.\n* Troubleshoot cloud deployment, integration, performance, and operational issues.\n* Monitor cloud environments and drive continuous improvements in performance, availability, security, and cost optimization.\n* Manage cloud platforms, automation tools, and disaster recovery testing.\n* Lead the resolution of critical cloud incidents and operational challenges.\n\n## Requirements\n\n* **6+ years** of experience in cloud infrastructure deployment and operations.\n* Strong hands-on experience with **AWS and Azure**, including enterprise-scale Day 1 and Day 2 activities.\n* Proficiency in **Terraform** and CloudFormation/ARM templates; Python scripting is a plus.\n* Experience with hybrid/multi-cloud environments; **GCP** knowledge is an advantage.\n* Strong understanding of cloud architecture, security, resilience, automation, and cost optimization.\n* Experience delivering cloud solutions for **enterprise or government clients in Singapore**.\n* Strong analytical, problem-solving, stakeholder management, and communication skills.\n* Ability to work effectively in fast-paced, Agile, and DevOps environments.\n\n## Preferred Certifications\n\n* AWS Certified Solutions Architect – Professional\n* Microsoft Azure Solutions Architect Expert\n* Certified Kubernetes Administrator (CKA)",
